late their ideas clearly and fluently?', 'Regarding the debate, ', 'Can they provide valid and persuasive arguments to support their stance?', 'Can they refute opponents’ arguments with strong reasons/evidence?', 'Those who come late more than 15 minutes may risk a mark penalty.']
